# Project intent

`app/main.py` is the file a human edits: categories, `Patch(...).add(...)` lists, and `AppConfig` rack indexes. Do not move that catalog into the package. Keep the sequential `.add` style and the existing explanatory comments.

Implementation lives under `app/carla_interface/`. `os/` is the piano-PC overlay (autostart, JACK, Carla project) — leave it alone unless asked.

Runtime is Linux (`oscsend`, bundled `app/assets/sendmidi`). Do not reintroduce Windows code paths.
